# Normalise line endings in the repository, and keep LF in working trees.
#
# The linter rejects CRLF, so a Windows contributor with `core.autocrlf=true`
# would otherwise see `npm run lint` fail on a clean checkout. Pinning the
# working tree to LF keeps the check reproducible everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
